    {
      "kind": "crux",
      "subject": "הלדרש … באים",
      "rationale": "Kumasen-ɲinini ye: 'aw bɛ n ɲinisɔ na wa?' — kelen-kelen bɛɛ bɛ a fɔ cogo kelen na nka a kɔrɔ kɔgɔji ye alefiridi ye (kɔrɔkɛbaw sɔngɔ)."
